/// \param X
///    A 128-bit integer vector.
/// \param N
///    An immediate value. Bit [0] specifies which 64-bit vector element from
///    the argument \a X to return. \n
///    0: Bits [63:0] are returned. \n
///    1: Bits [127:64] are returned. \n
